        "name": "Underworld Investigator",
        "system": {
          "actionType": {
            "value": "passive"
          },
          "actions": {
            "value": null
          },
          "category": "class",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p>Your work as an investigator makes you familiar with the criminal element. You might be a criminal yourself, or you might have gained an understanding of how they operate from the outside. You become trained in Underworld Lore, and you gain your @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Pursue a Lead] investigation bonus to Thievery checks to investigate a case (such as checks to @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Steal] a clue from a suspect or @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Pick a Lock] to open a safe with damning documents).</p>"
          },
